 \, Richard Breen \nWITH: Marilyn Monroe\, Joseph Cotten\, Jean Peters\, C
 asey Adams\n\nType: Screenings\n\nNewlyweds Ray and Polly Cutler (Jean Pet
 ers and Casey Adams) take a postponed honeymoon at Niagara Falls\, where t
 hey encounter Rose and George Loomis (Marilyn Monroe and Joseph Cotten). T
 he Loomis’s rocky relationship hangs over the couple’s romantic getawa
 y\, further complicated by a murder. 1953 was an important year for Monroe
  with the successes of Gentlemen Prefer Blondes and How to Marry a Million
 aire in the following months\, and her breakout performance as the sensual
  Rose in Niagara catapulted the actor into superstardom.
