BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Others in 4K
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260919T223000
DTSTAMP:20260902T123625Z
UID:019fc8a1-c131-9950-e0a1-628733d7c571@academymuseum.org
CATEGORIES:Screenings
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, September 19\, 2026 at 7:30 pm\n\nLocation: Academy
  Museum of Motion Pictures\n\nRuntime: 1h 44m\n\n2001 | 104 min | USA\, Sp
 ain\, France | Color | English | Rated PG-13 | 4K DCP\nDIRECTED BY: Alejan
 dro Amenábar \nWRITTEN BY: Alejandro Amenábar \nPRODUCED BY: Fernando Bo
 vaira\, José Luis Cuerda\, Sunmin Park \nWITH: Nicole Kidman\, Fionnula F
 lanagan\, Christopher Eccleston\, Elaine Cassidy\n\nType: Screenings\n\nGr
 ace Stewart (Nicole Kidman) keeps the curtains drawn at all hours of the d
 ay in her opulent manor to protect her children\, Anne and Nicholas\, from
  crippling photosensitivity. When three travelers appear in search of work
 \, Grace hires them to tend to the home and the children\, noting the prev
 ious employees “vanished” just days ago. The arrival of the new worker
 s seems to trigger paranormal incidents throughout the home. Set in 1945 J
 ersey\, United Kingdom\, this brooding psychological horror highlights the
  depths of Kidman’s range and Amenábar’s imagination.
LOCATION:Academy Museum of Motion Pictures
URL:https://www.academymuseum.org/en/programs/detail/the-others-019fc8a1-c
 131-9950-e0a1-628733d7c571
END:VEVENT
