 : Conversations\n\nWhat does it take to create an iconic horror prop\, suc
 h as the reverse bear trap in Saw (2004)? \nFrightfully talented special e
 ffects supervisor Tom Bellissimo takes museum visitors behind the scenes o
 f some of his best-known horror work\, including designs for Saw (2004)\, 
