DTSTAMP:20260902T123625Z
UID:019fedcc-b133-cd1f-84b0-1e9e3a37e7b7@academymuseum.org
CATEGORIES:Conversations
DESCRIPTION:Bid farewell to Barbie to Anna Karenina: The Cinematic Worlds 
 of Sarah Greenwood and Katie Spencer exhibition with Academy member and se
 t decorator Jan Pascale.\n\nSaturday\, October 3\, 2026 at 2 pm\n\nLocatio
 n: Level 3\n\nCost: Free with general admission\n\nType: Conversations\n\n
 Academy Member and set decorator Jan Pascale leads this rare peek into the
  wildly creative world of Hollywood sets\, props\, palettes\, and more. Do
 n't miss this chance to bid farewell to the Academy Museum exhibition Barb
 ie to Anna Karenina: The Cinematic Worlds of Sarah Greenwood and Katie Spe
 ncer with an Oscar winner.\nStay for a brief Q&A with Pascale after the pr
 ogram.
