 Museum of Motion Pictures\n\nRuntime: 1h 45m\n\n1955 | 105 min | USA | Col
 or | Scope | English | Not Rated | DCP \nDIRECTED BY: Billy Wilder \nPRODU
 CED BY: Charles K. Feldman\, Billy Wilder \nWRITTEN BY: Billy Wilder\, Geo
 rge Axelrod \nWITH: Marilyn Monroe\, Tommy Ewell\, Evelyn Keyes\, Sonny Tu
 fts\n\nType: Screenings\n\nOne of Monroe’s most successful roles was as 
 The Girl in director Billy Wilder’s The Seven Year Itch\, a comedy about
