UID:019fcdcc-e90f-643a-99a9-df2b6043372d@academymuseum.org
CATEGORIES:Screenings
DESCRIPTION:Thursday\, October 22\, 2026 at 7:30 pm\n\nLocation: Academy M
 useum of Motion Pictures\n\nRuntime: 7m\n\n1969 | 7 min | USA | Black-and-
 White | English | Not Rated | DCP  \nDIRECTED BY: John Carpenter \nWRITTEN
  BY: John Carpenter \nWITH: Jerry Cox\, Kathy Maynard\, Victor Ponderosa\,
  Jane Whiteridge\n\nType: Screenings\n\nCaptain VoyeurA restless computer 
 technician grows obsessed with a female coworker and secretly spies on her
 \, treating his voyeurism like the duties of a masked superhero/villain. T
 his short\, made while John Carpenter was a film student at the University
  of Southern California\, is rife with plot and filmmaking techniques he w
 ould later incorporate and improve upon in his slasher masterpiece Hallowe
 en (1978).
LOCATION:Academy Museum of Motion Pictures
URL:https://www.academymuseum.org/en/programs/detail/captain-voyeur-with-d
 ark-star-019fcdcc-e90f-643a-99a9-df2b6043372d
