  at 7:30 pm\n\nLocation: Academy Museum of Motion Pictures\n\nRuntime: 19m
 \n\n2015 | 19 min | Italy | Color | Italian with English subtitles | Not r
 ated | DCP \nDIRECTED BY: Alessandro Rossellini  \nWRITTEN BY: Angelica 
 Grizi\, Alessandro Rossellini\n\nType: Screenings\n\nViva Ingrid!  A movi
 ng documentary tribute to a mother\, wife\, and actress\, this mix of home
  movies\, newsreels\, and clips from films by Roberto Rossellini paints a 
 shortform portrait of three-time Academy Award-winning Swedish actress Ing
 rid Bergman\, as realized by one of Rossellini’s grandsons.
